# Back-propagate to ui-registry

When instructed to back-propagate a change from `src/components/` (or equivalent) back to `Script-Augur/ui-registry`:

1. Identify the modified component file(s).
2. Extract any project-specific utility classes or app-specific business logic so the component stays generic.
3. Draft a Git diff against https://github.com/Script-Augur/ui-registry.
4. Provide a PR title and description referencing the commit hash from this repo and explaining why the change benefits the core registry.
